-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON THE DATA FILES SHIPPED IN THIS REPOSITORY
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The MIT licence above covers the *code* in src/, tests/ and tools/, plus the
derived split files under data/processed/ and the deletion certificates under
artifacts/certificates/.

The derived splits are built from public upstream corpora and the terms of the
upstream datasets still apply to the passage text they contain:

  * DS1  MultiHop-RAG         -- see the dataset card of yixuantt/MultiHopRAG
  * DS2  BeIR/nq              -- see the dataset card of BeIR/nq
  * DS3  BeIR/trec-covid      -- see the dataset card of BeIR/trec-covid

The raw corpora themselves are not committed (see data/raw/README.md). If you
intend to redistribute the derived splits, check the upstream licence first.
